                 "Outcome: Scripts confirmed that every language's theory has as many chunks as the English, that its Swedish dialogue lines are the English theory's character for character, that in all 428 places where a dialogue line is a card's front its gloss contains that card's back in the same language, and that every text renders with the app's Markdown parser (markdown-it with markdown-it-cjk-friendly) with no stray emphasis marks. The headings and the French speakers' labels were made the same in both halves of each language."@en .

